  "prefLabel": "Ec-Wtr 104.01 Request for Access to Records",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ec-Wtr 104.01 Request for Access to Records.\n\n(a) Any person requesting access to council records under RSA 91-A shall direct a request as specified in (b) below.\n\n(b) A request to access council records shall be in writing and:\n\n(1) Identify as particularly as possible the information being sought;\n\n(2) Include a statement whereby the requestor agrees to pay a copying fee of $0.25 per page, if applicable; and\n\n(3) Be sent to the council secretary at the address specified in Ec-Wtr 103.01(a).\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Ec-Wtr 100) #13923, eff 4-11-24\n\nAPPENDIX\n\nRule | Statute\n\nEc-Wtr 101 | RSA 21-O:7; RSA 21-O:14; RSA 541-A:16, I(a)\n\nEc-Wtr 102 | RSA 21-O:7; RSA 21-O:14; RSA 541-A:16, I(a)\n\nEc-Wtr 103 | RSA 21-O:7; RSA 21-O:14; RSA 541-A:16, I(a)\n\nEc-Wtr 104 | RSA 21-O:7; RSA 21-O:14; RSA 541-A:16, I(a); RSA 91‑A",
